00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.470
GITHUB:
Have you ever wondered were all of the code

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:05.590
for your favorite websites and apps are stored?

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:10.190
Maybe on some sort of network of secret databases
and servers that are guarded by 7 layers of

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:13.120
encryption and firewalls and more security
than the Pentagon?

