GIT:
Speaking of Microsoft’s domination, with

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:29.630
over $100 billion in cash and liquid investments,
Microsoft wipes the floor with other Fortune

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:32.910
500 companies when it comes to cash reserves.

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:37.450
Most of these liquid investments are actually
in corporate and treasury bonds.

